rem Hybrid Integers
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=800

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

arg Base integer = 800800
arg Power integer = 800800

rem p^q q^p <= B^P is q ln p + p ln q
rem <= P ln B. For each prime p the
rem largest allowed prime q is found by
rem bisection on the integers, then the
rem prime counts are subtracted.
Base2 = Base * 1.0
Goal = Power * (Base2 log)
Wide = Goal / 0.6931471805599453
Top = (Wide + 2.0) integer
Primes = primes to Top copy
Below = (Primes at most Goal) integer
Ps = Primes take (Below sum)
Flags = array shape (Top + 1) fill 0
Flags Primes = 1
Prefix = Flags scan +
Lp = Ps log
Lo = Ps + 0
Hi = Lo * 0 + Top
for Round in 1 to 40
  Mid = (Lo + Hi + 1) // 2
  Cost = Mid * Lp + Ps * (Mid log)
  Fits = Cost at most Goal
  Lo = Fits choose Mid Lo
  Hi = Fits choose Hi (Mid - 1)
end
Gain = (Prefix Lo - Prefix Ps) max 0
return Gain sum
